274
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:38,480
A pitfall trap

275
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:44,040
Why is it an old man?

276
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:45,580
Damn it!

277
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:48,500
Come on, we're comrades, right?

278
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,200
Cherry Blossom King technique!

279
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:54,740
Well, you see,
we have our own circumstances too.

280
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,100
Cherry Blossom Household technique!

281
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:58,920
Frontal assault!

282
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:01,580
Cherry Blossom Viewing Jutsu!

283
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:07,120
Not yet...

284
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:09,180
Damn it, we're getting nowhere.

285
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:11,980
Ryotsu, do you copy? Ryotsu!

286
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:14,220
Yes, this is Ryotsu.

287
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:24,100
The schedule's been moved up. I'll be arriving in Japan tomorrow and should reach your location around noon.
You've reserved the spot properly, haven't you?

288
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:29,800
Nahahaha! Of course, sir! We're truly
looking forward to the Vice President's visit.

289
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:30,420
Well then.

290
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:37,100
Senpai, if it's come to this,
we have no choice but to use force.

291
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:50,020
I modified it just like Senpai told me to.

292
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:52,880
Let's go, Honda!

293
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:06,760
Here we come, you bastards!

294
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:18,900
Cherry Blossom Block Technique!

295
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:24,480
Get out of the way! You're in the way!

296
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,480
Break it!

297
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:37,280
Damn you! If that's how you want it!

298
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:42,540
What?

299
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:46,660
Cherry Blossom Mecha Technique!

300
00:20:47,580 --> 00:20:50,580
Aaaaaaah!

301
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,140
Aaaaaaah!

302
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:00,080
Damn it!

303
00:21:01,340 --> 00:21:02,540
Aaaaaah!

304
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:10,840
Aaaaaah! Why are you sitting down in front of the cherry blossoms,
taking pictures?

305
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:11,320
Four

306
00:21:11,320 --> 00:21:11,980
Yo!

307
