00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:45,460
Ho ho ho.

330
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:49,460
We should be seeing the Mannen-zakura soon,
Mr. Vice President.

331
00:21:49,460 --> 00:21:51,760
What's that helicopter?

332
00:21:56,260 --> 00:21:58,120
Stop it, senpai!

333
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,800
We did it!

334
00:22:08,220 --> 00:22:08,660
Who?

335
00:22:43,080 --> 00:22:44,820
What are we going to do, senpai?

336
00:22:44,820 --> 00:22:48,380
There's no way we can
talk our way out of this.

337
00:22:48,380 --> 00:22:52,400
A lame excuse will only make them angrier.

338
00:22:54,540 --> 00:22:57,140
Right, in situations like this,
it's George Washington!

339
00:22:57,140 --> 00:23:01,200
America's first president,
George Washington,

340
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:05,820
when he confessed as a boy to cutting down a cherry tree,
wasn't scolded.

341
00:23:07,220 --> 00:23:09,440
Any vice president would know that story.

342
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:13,580
If I honestly confess,
I'm sure I'll be forgiven too.

343
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:19,700
Ryotsu! You bastard!

344
00:23:21,020 --> 00:23:22,940
Sorry, Vice President.

345
00:23:22,940 --> 00:23:25,740
I'm the one who cut down the cherry tree.

346
00:23:26,220 --> 00:23:27,780
Forgive me, pretty please with a topknot!

347
00:23:31,860 --> 00:23:33,780
I'll take responsibility the Japanese way.

348
00:23:33,780 --> 00:23:34,860
I can't even disembowel myself!

349
00:23:34,860 --> 00:23:36,940
It's for Japan-U.S. friendship!

350
00:23:36,940 --> 00:23:38,540
Go gracefully, and die with dignity.

351
00:23:38,540 --> 00:23:39,000
No way...

352
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:40,980
Have mercy, please.

353
00:23:44,300 --> 00:23:47,020
I hate cherry-blossom viewing!

354
00:24:05,520 --> 00:24:11,260
The strange feeling we had back then

355
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:16,960
So, on the tiles of the arcade street,

356
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:22,740
I tried walking only on the black ones.

357
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:28,920
Everyone was a child once,

358
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:31,020
but everyone has forgotten.

359
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:35,040
Politicians with their self-important faces

360
00:24:35,040 --> 00:24:38,360
and aunties with blue eyeshadow, too,

361
00:24:38,860 --> 00:24:41,340
try turning the corner.

362
00:24:41,940 --> 00:24:43,920
That corner there.

363
00:24:44,940 --> 00:24:49,120
You'll get to see everyone, everyone.

364
00:24:51,120 --> 00:24:54,120
Over there is Kameari,

365
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:57,580
surely it's Kameari,

366
00:24:58,380 --> 00:25:02,340
everyone, come to our town!

367
00:25:02,340 --> 00:25:06,960
Over there is Kameari,

368
00:25:08,120 --> 00:25:10,240
surely it's Kameari,

369
00:25:11,220 --> 00:25:15,560
