370
00:25:16,380 --> 00:25:17,080
Thank you.

371
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:23,400
If we make the movie a huge hit, I think...

372
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,780
That's a good story, isn't it?

373
00:25:24,780 --> 00:25:27,260
If I help out, success is guaranteed!

374
00:25:27,800 --> 00:25:30,240
I'll make a film that earns 30 billion yen!

375
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:33,120
Nobody said anything about doing stunts too!

376
00:25:33,540 --> 00:25:35,780
Next time: Ryotsu's movie debut?

377
00:25:36,220 --> 00:25:36,860
Looking forward to working with you.

378
00:25:42,660 --> 00:25:42,980
Thank you.

